{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026q3OrhuMRD71792669059.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>內地機械人龍頭企業宇樹科技推出一款人形機械人，識得打功夫，還夠力抬起汽車救人。</p><p></p><p>空翻、騰空肘擊、連環腿，多個高難度動作行雲流水。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_ROBOT_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026kQ9WSopR9q1792668960.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>這個身高182厘米、體重約70公斤的「大隻佬」，就是宇樹科技新推出的「H2-X功夫傳奇守護」人形機械人，它能從4米高台跳下完成後滾翻平穩落地，在危機時刻能挺身而出，同持刀襲擊者近身搏鬥，還可以徒手抬起汽車，救出車底的被困者，主打防護及應急避險等能力，電池續航最長可達8小時，片段中強調是全程實拍。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.ROBOT-1830_005.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Pxyk6jdnnA1792669080.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>有別於之前在春晚，以及北京天壇公園展示的表演機械人，宇樹指今次推出的「H2-X」機械人具有處理應急救援的能力，不過片段中有提示跟同這款機械人保持2至3米安全距離。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T12:51:02.884577+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":295,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T11:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:36.022433+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T12:46:36.022433+00:00","content_hash":"c8502e4b8333def7b3b14ae5ee57c69e3997dfa3e601c8336248d5a0674a1df7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}